egory_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","review_id":"zqRD_R5J343h-YE26BsZRA","date":"2017-09-17T20:33:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9164814949035645,"text_excerpt":"Good little coffee shop with some tasty drinks and breakfast pastries. It was just down the street from our hotel and run by some nice ladies so we came a couple of times for a caffeine boost. The interior is small, so not a lot of people can sit inside at the same time, but we never had trouble grabbing a table for a few minutes. My only caution is that their caramel latte was tasty, but there was way too much sugar / caramel, and it was sweet enough most of the way through, and then the last few inches of coffee were almost all sugar. I'd recommend asking for \"light caramel / sugar\" unless you like it really sweet. I do recommend the almond croissant though! SO GOOD! Especially warmed up!"},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","review_id":"79y5P6RhwGZuS-S1a1OU-w","date":"2016-06-12T00:38:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9136488437652588,"text_excerpt":"Wow these places are everywhere in New Orleans. We popped in during the middle of a couple days of vacation for iced coffee. Great service, very prompt. Their coffee is pretty good and I like that they have stevia available. Spacious seating area. Two thumps up."},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","review_id":"7lr8j4Kvk8KOUJ6pFLmbiQ","date":"2018-01-02T03:09:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9134344458580017,"text_excerpt":"Great local coffee in New Orleans, comparable to Coffee Bean. Better than Starbucks. White Chocolate Latte is delicious, as is the Caramel Creme Coffee. However, these drinks are very sweet! Maybe ask for less flavoring, unless you like it that way. The coffee is hot, baristas are friendly, and it is convenient if you are walking the streets and need a little energy boost! Beware: the inside of this chain is TINY if you're looking for somewhere to sit. Would return if I'm in the area."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","photo_id":"77YIV80wwngupJR9kWr02Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/77YIV80wwngupJR9kWr02Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8665555715560913},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","photo_id":"uV4OmYpx6cQjPlexKlbeqA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/uV4OmYpx6cQjPlexKlbeqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8612421154975891},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","photo_id":"jL1vB57wbtPYyE2x94236g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jL1vB57wbtPYyE2x94236g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8514184951782227},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","photo_id":"niR66zx97aXg1IYTGBa-ig","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/niR66zx97aXg1IYTGBa-ig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8303166627883911},{"business_id":"lZ88MntSXZXDvpZAcXgiAg","photo_id":"bpXLxag5VUhK9rcEKbj5HQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/bpXLxag5VUhK9rcEKbj5HQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7901368141174316}]},"notebook_case":null}
